+    `GrantKeywordToOwnSpells(CASCADE, Any.withCardPredicate(IsColorless).manaValueAtLeast(7), fromZone = HAND)`.
+    `maxManaValue` (a `DynamicAmount`, evaluated for the grant's controller at cast) caps the spell's mana value and
+    `duringYourTurnOnly` limits the grant to its controller's turn — **Abaddon the Despoiler**:
+    `GrantKeywordToOwnSpells(CASCADE, Any, fromZone = HAND, maxManaValue = TurnTracking(EachOpponent, LIFE_LOST_AMOUNT),
+    duringYourTurnOnly = true)`. Only granted cascade evaluates `maxManaValue`; every other reader of a capped grant
+    fails closed.
   - **STORM** (and other "each instance triggers separately" cast keywords) are counted by
     `GrantedKeywordResolver.countGrants` when `CastSpellHandler` builds the spell's storm triggers — one storm
     instance per matching grant (CR 702.40b), added to the printed-keyword count. **Prismari, the Inspiration** =
